  "generation_prompts": [
    "Create a premium, restrained EDITORIAL ILLUSTRATION BACKGROUND ONLY for a 1080 x 1920 vertical Instagram Story about a payments-technology company's workforce reduction. Distinct JOBS & EMPLOYMENT visual style: warm porcelain and pale stone office architecture, ink-charcoal details, muted slate glass, and a few precise burnt-orange accents inspired by payment technology. No people, no company logos, no writing, no numbers, no charts, no coin portraits or coin lettering. This is conceptual office/payments imagery, not a photograph of Fiserv premises. Composition is crucial: from x=0 to about 890 and y=0 to1560, provide a calm pale ivory matte architectural surface with extremely subtle warm texture, entirely unobstructed for dark news typography. A slim tactile vertical graphite/bronze architectural column occupies x=905 to1080; at center approximately x=990,y=470 create one SMALL realistic circular recessed medallion mount, with an INNER EMPTY flat dark face 145px diameter, surrounded by a slim warm brushed-metal rim, realistic directional light and contact shadow. The recess must be front-facing and perfectly circular, made to receive an exact separate brand coin later, with no coin artwork generated. Keep the mount away from the left text area; entire mount within y=360 to580. At the bottom quarter, below y=1570, reveal a sophisticated quiet modern payments-office still life: subtle workstation glass, a generic unbranded card-payment terminal, a dark chair partly tucked under a light stone desk, and a burnt-orange cable/detail; cinematic realistic materials, soft evening daylight, controlled shadows, no dramatic disaster imagery, no charts or screens with text. The office scene should be richly photographic but subdued, with the light architectural surface blending naturally into the desk scene. Strong usable negative space throughout upper four fifths; no objects through the headline area. Final composition will later add the exact compact one-line brand 'MONEYBERG NEWS BRIEF' using actual Lato Black900, along with Lato Black900 headline/labels and Georgia body/source (minimum33px labels/sources,35px body,51px headlines), all inside x104\u2013961,y164\u20131536; DO NOT draw that text yourself. Exact supplied Moneyberg coin will be installed separately into this physical recess and must remain wholly in upper75% of canvas. Generate ONLY this text-free environmental background. Do not add a white card, footer, watermarks, imaginary company logo, emblem or lettering."
